The '''Eternal Hoof''' is a {{Rare}} [[Accessory]] that grants an additional {{Green|2%}} chance of finding a [[Trick or Treat Chest]] when killing a mob during the [[Spooky Festival]]. It is the upgraded form of a [[Lucky Hoof]].

